कियत्|कियन्त्
कियत् kí-yat, a. how great? how far? how 🞄long? how various? of what kind? of what 🞄value? kíyat, ad. how far? how much? wherefore? 🞄= uselessly;<BR> indef. prn. a. small, little, 🞄some;<BR> n. ad. a little, somewhat;<BR> with following 🞄ca & preceding yāvat, however great;<BR> of whatever 🞄kind;<BR> with api, however great;<BR> kíyati‿ā́, 🞄(lc. with prp. ā́) since how long?<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MD&page=068-3" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=md" target="_blank">Correction</a>

