च|चः
च ca, encl. cj. (τε, que) and;<BR> also;<BR> even, 🞄just;<BR> but, yet;<BR> if (= ced): ca-ca, both — and, as 🞄well — as, scarcely — as, scarcely — when;<BR> although — yet: with 🞄negative, neither — nor;<BR> ca-na ca or tu, although-yet 🞄not;<BR> naca-ca, although not — yet;<BR> 🞄with vā, either, or;<BR> ca‿eva ca‿api, and also;<BR> 🞄anyac ca api ca, tathā ca, moreover, 🞄likewise (adding a similar saying);<BR> ca 🞄gives interrogatives (q. v.) an indefinite sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MD&page=090-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=md" target="_blank">Correction</a>

