चिद् ci-d, enc. pcl. [n. of interrogative, Lat. 🞄-quid] in V. emphasizing preceding word (but 🞄often to be rendered by stress merely), even, 🞄just, very, at least;<BR> generalizing nouns, every, 🞄all, and esp. pns. and cjs., -ever, all: with 🞄neg. not even;<BR> in C. it is used only with interrogatives 🞄(and jātu), rendering them indefinite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MD&page=094-3" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=md" target="_blank">Correction</a>

