ce: 🞄in. according to prevailing usage;<BR> -bhartṛ, 🞄m. supporter of the people;<BR> -maheśvara, m. 🞄great lord of the world, ep. of Kṛṣṇa, -mātṛ, f. mother of the world, ep. of Gaurī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=MD&page=264-3" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=md" target="_blank">Correction</a>

